---
import SimplePage from "../../../components/SimplePage.astro";
---

<SimplePage
  title="Careers at Gene Johnson"
  description="Join a family-owned trades company that's been growing since 1976. Apprenticeships, licensed positions, and dispatch/office roles across the Puget Sound area."
  path="/about-us/careers/"
  eyebrow="Careers"
  tagline="Build a trade career with a company that's been around for 50 years - and plans to be around for 50 more."
  icon="Fixters"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "About Us", href: "/about-us/" }, { name: "Careers" }]}
>
  <p>
    We hire across every trade we practice - plumbing, HVAC, and electrical - at every experience level, from apprentices just starting out to master-licensed technicians. We also regularly hire for dispatch, customer service, and warehouse roles that keep the trucks running on time.
  </p>

  <h2>What we look for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A genuine respect for customers' homes and time</li>
    <li>Willingness to explain your work in plain language, not jargon</li>
    <li>Valid trade license or active apprenticeship (for field roles)</li>
    <li>A clean driving record</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What you get</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Competitive, experience-based pay plus performance incentives</li>
    <li>A stocked, well-maintained company vehicle for field roles</li>
    <li>Ongoing manufacturer training and certification support</li>
    <li>Health benefits and retirement contribution options</li>
    <li>A genuinely family-owned culture - not a franchise, not private equity</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to apply</h2>
  <p>
    Give us a call at our main line or reach out through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> with your experience and the role you're interested in, and our team will follow up directly.
  </p>
</SimplePage>
